Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.86,0:03:20.28,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,221,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(5160,5420,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}去愛變化無常的每一天
