Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.92,0:03:32.75,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,230,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(4499,4830,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}用總是層疊成圈的聲音
